# ERP Management System

Full-stack ERP management system built with:

- Angular
- Node.js
- Express.js
- MongoDB
- Mongoose
- JWT

## Modules

- Authentication
- Users
- Departments
- Employees
- Attendance
- Leaves
- Products
- Warehouses
- Stock
- Suppliers
- Purchases
- Customers
- Sales
- Invoices
- Payments
- Reports
- Audit Logs
- Notifications

## Main Business Flows

### Purchase

Supplier
→ Purchase
→ Confirm
→ Receive
→ Stock IN

### Sales

Customer
→ Sale
→ Confirm
→ Stock OUT

### Payments

Sale
→ Invoice
→ Payment
→ Paid / Partially Paid
